        "original_id": "320f3f80-8685-50c2-8133-91996a944d0c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pork Soda, Dr. Martens footwear\n- People: Hank Williams Jr., Cher, Jerry Garcia, Jimi Hendrix, James Brown\n- Organizations: Pink Floyd, the Residents, Costco\n- Works: Macbeth, Bottom, Ren & Stimpy\n- Concepts: pop culture references, footwear design\n\nFacts:\n- The album Pork Soda contains pop culture references to Hank Williams Jr., Cher, Pink Floyd, the Residents, Jerry Garcia, Jimi Hendrix, James Brown, Macbeth, Costco, Bottom, Ren & Stimpy, and Dr. Martens.\n- Dr. Martens footwear is distinguished by an air-cushioned sole called Bouncing Soles, a specific upper shape, welted construction, and yellow stitching.",
